Problem	Solution
Can't find API Keys menu	Look harder in left sidebar — it's there
Key not working	Make sure you copied the full key with sk- prefix
"Insufficient balance" error	Need to add payment method and top up
Rate limit errors	You're going too fast — add a small delay between calls
