bash
streamlit run app.py
⚡ Performance Tips (since you're on Windows):
First run will be slow (model loads into RAM) — subsequent runs faster

Close other apps if you have 8GB RAM or less

CPU-only mode works fine, just slower than GPU

If it's too slow → use deepseek-r1:1.5b instead (smaller, faster, slightly less smart):

